 "remarks": "A rare, prestinely move-in ready multifamily opportunity in Greenwich. Fully turn-key side-by-side two-family home tucked away on a quiet dead-end street in Greenwich's Chickahominy neighborhood. Offering approximately 3,100 sq. ft. of finished living space, this turnkey property delivers a new-home feel with exceptional flexibility for owner occupants who want rental income or an investor looking for a turn-key opportunity. The larger unit offers approximately 1,500 sq. ft. with 4 bedrooms and 3 full baths, plus approximately 930 sq. ft. of fully finished, above-ground lower-level space with a private walk-in entrance. Ideal for a guest suite. The second residence offers approximately 690 sq. ft. with 1 bedroom and 1 full bath. The property has a spacious backyard, a large garage, and 3 separate laundry areas total. Enjoy incredibly low property taxes and a peaceful residential setting just 2 minutes to I-95, 5 minutes to Greenwich Train Station, 5 minutes to the beach, and 7 minutes to Greenwich Avenue.",
